          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a8fd9035bda6476f8a72faacfb4eeaf62b5965195818a4c8b59fa08e205035e6:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_cd0f11f57566495a8bff7e822f365666",
      "statement": "EveSmsQueueTest (driving drainOne deterministically with the worker stopped) verifies the queue the bridge relies on — priority ordering, idempotency, the QUEUED to ACTIVE to SENT|FAILED flow, cancellation, and the GMweb-compatible verification fields (confirmed on success, manual_review_required on failure, with a persistence round-trip); GatewayAccessPolicyTest pins the canTransmit gate the poller relies on; OutboxPoller itself is not directly unit-tested because it requires a live network.",
